The default pixelflux build uses libx264 as its software H.264 encoder.
libx264 is GPL-2.0-or-later. pixelflux also supports a GPL-free build
using OpenH264 when PIXELFLUX_ENABLE_GPL=0.

Additional software installed by the Docker image, including Ubuntu,
Google Chrome, FFmpeg libraries, PulseAudio, Openbox, nginx and their
